OL,3,ADiesel tanker carrying up to 7,000     
OL,4,Atonnes capsizes near Ibiza, killing one
OL,6,FAn oil tanker carrying up to 7,000     
OL,7,Ftonnes of diesel has capsized off the  
OL,8,Fcoast of Ibiza, leaving one crew member
OL,9,Fdead, authorities have said.           
OL,11,FThe Med Emre, a Malta-flagged vessel,  
OL,12,Fwas carrying 17 crew members who were  
OL,13,Fall rescued. However seven were taken  
OL,14,Fto hospital and one was later          
OL,15,Fpronounced dead, Balearic Islands      
OL,16,Femergency services confirmed.          
OL,18,FThe six crew receiving treatment       
OL,19,Freportedly suffered minor injuries,    
OL,20,Fsuch as hypothermia, Spanish media     
OL,21,Freports.                               
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
