OL,3,ADiesel tanker carrying up to 7,000     
OL,4,Atonnes capsizes near Ibiza, killing one
OL,6,FThe possible environmental damage is   
OL,7,Fbeing assessed by a plane and Spain's  
OL,8,Fpollution control vessel, Clara        
OL,9,FCampoamor, which is owned by the       
OL,10,Fcountry's national maritime rescue     
OL,11,Fservice.                               
